==========================================================================

Target:   skills/spec-double-2/scripts/complexity_ledger.py (the TEMPLATE constant)
Unit:     tla-spec-dev
Proposed by: SI-05 (issue #338). NOT applied here: the TEMPLATE constant lives in
          complexity_ledger.py, outside SI-05's conflict keys.

Re-verified on the epic tip (994f650c): `record_complexity_ledger` accepts a
`tlc_report` path and fills `distinct_states` from it, but the scaffolded
`complexity_ledger.yaml` TEMPLATE offers no field for that path and never
mentions the filename convention. So the figure is still filled only by the
three-filename probe inside the ticket's own `results/` directory, which is why
the epic's headline reachable-state numbers were recorded as null.

